meta {
  name: Approve
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/approvals/{{approvalId}}/decision
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "note": "Sesuai budget, disetujui"
  }
}

docs {
  Approver terkait atau delegate aktif.
  Kalau masih ada level berikutnya -> travel jadi IN_REVIEW, approver berikutnya dapat notifikasi.
  Kalau ini level terakhir -> travel jadi APPROVED.
  Approve ulang tiap level (1 MANAGER, 2 DEPARTMENT_HEAD, 3 HRD) sampai travel APPROVED.
}
